[{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其三","author":"李彭","text":"境静轮鞅寡，阶空络纬多。\n萧然正遐瞩，脱叶下庭柯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":790,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其四","author":"李彭","text":"我初卧病时，桑麻翳负郭。\n扶杖延秋风，山川俱黄落。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":791,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其五","author":"李彭","text":"寒温机中素，荣歇洞庭叶。\n发兴鸥鸟行，风烟理舟楫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":792,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其六","author":"李彭","text":"平生老骥心，伏枥端有在。\n华月生夜凉，南窗歌慷慨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":793,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其七","author":"李彭","text":"园中有奇货，雨满瓜芋田。\n一饱吾已足，望山思悠然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":794,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其八","author":"李彭","text":"结交何用早，士贵心相知。\n苟合殊真味，咄咄成乖离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":795,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其九","author":"李彭","text":"林庐亦云乐，欲语辄复已。\n取琴抚徽弦，妙不在宫徵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":796,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予夏中卧病起已见落叶因取渊明诗门庭多落叶慨然知已秋赋十章遣兴 其十","author":"李彭","text":"沅湘歌九辩，梁父吟四愁。\n虚斋无一事，坐对楚江秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":797,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太平小寺","author":"李彭","text":"行尽斜峰急涧，忽看化寺神居。\n云琐沉沉复阁，旁看贝叶遗书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":798,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昌书记画梅","author":"李彭","text":"花柳春风纷衍，禅窗晚放横枝。\n虢国生憎粉黛，晚妆淡扫蛾眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":799,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐兼戏环上人 其一","author":"李彭","text":"蠹简聊宽岑寂，榴花颇慰榛芜。\n莫问草玄上白，须令看碧成朱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":800,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐兼戏环上人 其二","author":"李彭","text":"毛发早惊蒲柳，衣裾又变风烟。\n我是一丘一壑，君应三要三玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":801,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐兼戏环上人 其三","author":"李彭","text":"落木霜猿到耳，风高候雁横空。\n觅句深凭料理，解围俄听晨钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":802,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昌书记画驯猿","author":"李彭","text":"巫峡猿啼向曙，云何却在樊笼。\n想见珍羞豢养，翻思槲叶微风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":803,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庭梅","author":"李彭","text":"春风日日下丘园，绿到萱芽蕨破拳。\n莫怪庭梅晚来好，尚堪桃李与争妍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":804,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赠择言两绝句 其一","author":"李彭","text":"忆昨同倾三昧酒，论文时掇百家衣。\n他年准拟兰亭会，好画高人支遁师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":805,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赠择言两绝句 其二","author":"李彭","text":"逍遥儒墨两专场，万遍莲花嫁马郎。\n心若死灰诗欲尽，乞侬西国更生香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":806,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舍弟彤检校南庄刈稻中秋日作三绝句见寄醉后偶次其韵答之 其一","author":"李彭","text":"天南云破玉绳横，上有蟾蜍云外明。\n共把一杯怀少雁，新诗深悉未归情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":807,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舍弟彤检校南庄刈稻中秋日作三绝句见寄醉后偶次其韵答之 其二","author":"李彭","text":"呼邻贳酒酒如冰，以酒攻愁愁有城。\n醉舞不须看短舞，神清便觉映肤清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":808,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舍弟彤检校南庄刈稻中秋日作三绝句见寄醉后偶次其韵答之 其三","author":"李彭","text":"珍重江南庾子山，诗名晚岁满江关。\n应须剩读书千卷，始在班扬伯仲间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":809,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答徐十赠诗三绝句 其一","author":"李彭","text":"东湖高士有云孙，句梦池塘论过秦。\n海内故人流落尽，病夫杯渡不嫌频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":810,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答徐十赠诗三绝句 其二","author":"李彭","text":"窗中山色扑衣襟，户外江声醒客心。\n我在山阴君在剡，思君行坐短长吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":811,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答徐十赠诗三绝句 其三","author":"李彭","text":"炉薰细细绕禅房，竹日晖晖映短墙。\n安得买邻同岁晚，钵盂分饭共绳床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":812,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答谢迈秀才三绝句 其一","author":"李彭","text":"饱闻玉树阶庭长，今见凭虚意欲仙。\n遣我池塘梦春草，阿连风味剧堪怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":813,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答谢迈秀才三绝句 其二","author":"李彭","text":"短李门前无宁馨，书淫诗痴类天成。\n多情喜有谢康乐，步屧同寻鸥鸟盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":814,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答谢迈秀才三绝句 其三","author":"李彭","text":"平生抱瑟齐门立，不比吴宫誇靓妆。\n周鼎商盘甚淳古，君来独慰九回肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":815,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答黄直夫二首 其一","author":"李彭","text":"红颜绿发花映肉，别去年颜存语音。\n秉烛相看真梦寐，细听存没欲薰心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":816,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答黄直夫二首 其二","author":"李彭","text":"笔底澜翻走百川，胸中书传作丰年。\n自怜疲马老伏枥，绝影如公更着鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":817,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答九弟首夏郊园即事 其一","author":"李彭","text":"疏泉方作薜萝深，月落参横要共斟。\n径醉逃禅真粲可，冥搜得隽近韩岑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":818,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答九弟首夏郊园即事 其二","author":"李彭","text":"阿连句里欲回春，早慎论交思不群。\n莫愿才堪任遗补，来参折臂大冯君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":819,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答九弟首夏郊园即事 其三","author":"李彭","text":"营巢燕子语犹新，接叶莺雏已晚春。\n催晓鸟乌声更乐，直疑料理废诗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":820,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答九弟首夏郊园即事 其四","author":"李彭","text":"何须痛诋程不识，未用亲摩史谒居。\n昔时万事愁眉外，顿觉幽怀常晏如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":821,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵 其一","author":"李彭","text":"懒觅新诗劝春住，只愁尘爵每空斟。\n馀酣晚漱沙汀外，未羡明登天姥岑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":822,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵 其二","author":"李彭","text":"陈恬老作中州客，少室晓猿声念群。\n通籍金闺成底事，看取九原冥漠君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":823,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵 其三","author":"李彭","text":"古木千章夏阴合，瓮头别作醉乡春。\n草玄不是扬雄事，定自免为投阁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":824,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵 其四","author":"李彭","text":"种葵艺瓠成畦垄，奇货由来果可居。\n汉代封君浑未称，故侯风韵拟相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":825,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元亮次韵四绝相撩和答 其一","author":"李彭","text":"枕中鸿宝袅蹄金，火候宁经手自斟。\n瓠子河倾那可塞，忍令清饿首阳岑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":826,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元亮次韵四绝相撩和答 其二","author":"李彭","text":"少陵独见阮生论，我乐同乡独乐群。\n两阮八龙浑可拟，操戈披靡独输君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":827,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元亮次韵四绝相撩和答 其三","author":"李彭","text":"久知瓮底堪肥遁，近觉樽中每着春。\n狗窦相呼竟何补，献酬故属画眉人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":828,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元亮次韵四绝相撩和答 其四","author":"李彭","text":"仲子酒狂言语疏，文章敢比茂陵居。\n未见远山堪病渴，直愁涤器枉相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":829,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明 其一","author":"李彭","text":"汀草汀鸥解唤愁，舍南舍北度鸣鸠。\n深凭竹叶留春住，未信桃花逐水流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":830,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明 其二","author":"李彭","text":"高柳半天浑欲眠，二毛苦上接篱边。\n兴深杯杓怀山简，勾梦池塘忆惠连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":831,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明 其三","author":"李彭","text":"晚将曲蘖寄吾真，不道公当恕醉人。\n欲学少年花压帽，却疑花笑及花嗔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":832,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登耶舍塔","author":"李彭","text":"五峰罗列斗南垂，百代堂堂歌紫芝。\n一老去为西伯用，四翁应笑北山移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":833,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春意三绝 其一","author":"李彭","text":"屋角鸟呼春意回，江花江柳自相催。\n废诗诗思涩如棘，勾引无劳酒作媒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":834,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春意三绝 其二","author":"李彭","text":"裁云为柳雪为花，恼乱中年春意赊。\n庭宇风微教驯鹤，池塘日暖浴娇鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":835,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春意三绝 其三","author":"李彭","text":"日日映阶春草香，春风到处着胡床。\n梅梢何许蜂酿蜜，来采幽园宫样黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":836,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题温泉","author":"李彭","text":"能使时平四十春，开元圣主得贤臣。\n当时姚宋并燕许，尽是骊山从驾人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":837,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晖上人画梅乞诗","author":"李彭","text":"微风正尔送荷气，忽见巩梅冰霰姿。\n元是道人三昧力，明窗漱墨发南枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":838,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西塔","author":"李彭","text":"峰前日出雾初散，溪上雨来禽乱啼。\n欲记宁游三峡处，诗成赖有董胶西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":839,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起 其一","author":"李彭","text":"林间稚竹犹含箨，柳下孙枝屡放绵。\n午梦不知清昼永，娇莺啼破晚窗前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":840,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起 其二","author":"李彭","text":"奕奕柔桑霜后繁，缲丝无复茧盆翻。\n愿同园客茧如瓮，忍使疲民无复裈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":841,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起 其三","author":"李彭","text":"鸟雀雄猜作伴飞，机心还复堕危机。\n何如绚练堂前燕，拂面衔泥点客衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":842,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起 其四","author":"李彭","text":"穱麦翻畦雉羽斑，郊园贳酒有馀欢。\n奈何苦雨倾沧海，坐遣南翁衣带宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":843,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起 其五","author":"李彭","text":"石阙林端昼夜啼，罗生芳草绿成蹊。\n扶筇携幼出门巷，雨过舟横水满溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":844,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠行密上人","author":"李彭","text":"东风未解北风愠，腊雪半消春雪深。\n欲向僧房觅清昼，细听山暝孤猿吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":845,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次李仪中韵送杲上人归龙安","author":"李彭","text":"不作郊原雉应媒，心随山色翠成堆。\n翩然一钵自归去，有意杖藜还复来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":846,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠嗣誉二首坐 其一","author":"李彭","text":"谈禅高出沩仰右，著论耻居生肇傍。\n更有新诗堪抵罪，与君约法定三章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":847,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠嗣誉二首坐 其二","author":"李彭","text":"僧中君是玉花骢，气逸浑将入古风。\n欲向松窗翻妙语，愧无笔力到方融。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":848,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其一","author":"李彭","text":"懒慢经时不出门，秋风藜杖稍相亲。\n念群属玉鸣埼岸，作伴蜻蜓上角巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":849,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其二","author":"李彭","text":"病厌鹅儿酒色黄，蔬盂终日似僧房。\n驯猿时复攘新果，夕鸟飞来啄蠹床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":850,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其三","author":"李彭","text":"初无勾漏为丹砂，何必青门始种瓜。\n口腹累人吾岂敢，深劳溪友饷鱼虾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":851,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其四","author":"李彭","text":"啼乌引子来衣桁，野鹭衔鱼堕屋除。\n百念已忘馀习在，手持叔夜养生书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":852,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其五","author":"李彭","text":"利口毁誉本无嫌，空洞腹中须属厌。\n何用灞陵嗔尉醉，未劳汉署叹郎潜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":853,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其六","author":"李彭","text":"畦间魁芋敌蹲鸱，木末深悬大谷梨。\n小摘已堪充米价，煨尝聊用补朝饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":854,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中即事 其七","author":"李彭","text":"络纬井干空复啼，萧然脱叶望秋衰。\n最怜庭下婆娑桧，郁郁已含梁栋姿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":855,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题 其一","author":"李彭","text":"草阁柴扉旧逐凉，蘋风一曲洒回塘。\n尚馀新月张敞画，无复么荷韩寿香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":856,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题 其二","author":"李彭","text":"篱边日出抚孤松，户外云生遮数峰。\n避冷随阳闻过雁，催昏唤曙听疏钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":857,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题 其三","author":"李彭","text":"寒鸦衔枝欲定巢，近同客食上林梢。\n能逃岁德安门户，出处悬应不浪交。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":858,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题 其四","author":"李彭","text":"纷纷眼界秃居士，却著云山坏衲衣。\n箴孔线蹊无量义，谁能于此顿知归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":859,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题 其五","author":"李彭","text":"秦郎本是金闺彦，撰次宁为仙董狐。\n西狩获麟虽绝笔，道山今日要真儒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":860,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题 其六","author":"李彭","text":"韩侯数奇亦云极，奈此风流英妙何。\n传闻东观已著作，即看西掖与銮坡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":861,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山道中 其一","author":"李彭","text":"无复春风绿发前，索花共笑过年年。\n只今老境花无赖，媒蘖幽人作醉眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":862,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山道中 其二","author":"李彭","text":"崇桃灼灼昡清昼，细柳依依迷远村。\n似听渊明赋归去，柴桑幽鸟语黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":863,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山道中 其三","author":"李彭","text":"三年不饮虎溪水，一笑来尝鹰爪芽。\n岑寂仲堪谈易地，祇馀苍藓藉残花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":864,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山道中 其四","author":"李彭","text":"董仙种杏令虎守，只今但见莲花峰。\n鍊师欲作小隐计，馀力犹堪追祖风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":865,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山道中 其五","author":"李彭","text":"忆昨山阴峰上头，山腰云雨半含愁。\n苍崖壁立题名处，光怪时时射斗牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":866,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山道中 其六","author":"李彭","text":"萧杌斋中天马驹，追风未试且幽居。\n剧谈挽我留三日，不费一鸱传异书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":867,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]